# Data and model artefacts (large, re-downloadable, or generated).
# Anchored to the repository root. Unanchored, "data/" matches a directory of
# that name at any depth, which silently excluded the whole of foresight/data
# -- the flow loader, the graph features and the packet extractor were all
# untracked and the published repository was missing its data layer.
/data/
/checkpoints/
/runs/
*.pcap
*.pcapng
*.csv
*.parquet
*.pt
*.pth
*.joblib
.cache/

